      "asset_id": "wikimedia:File:Caspar David Friedrich - Wanderer above the sea of fog.jpg",
      "notes": "Why/what-then: students must not leave thinking FA = automatic good picks. Convergent work still needs criteria, comparison, and craft — attention style is only one tool.",
